    # | ----------------- | -------------------------------- | -------- | ------------- |
    # | report_processing | {Client#get_abuse_report_status} | 1        | 5             |
    #
    # @raise [Errors::FailureStateError] Raised when the waiter terminates
    #   because the waiter has entered a state that it will not transition
